            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f2" n="2" xml:id="d145-f2-content">
                <p>Madame Nhu.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f3" n="3" xml:id="d145-f3-content">
                <p>Harriman’s conversation with Friendly of CBS is not printed. (Memorandum of
                    telephone conversation, September 23; Library of Congress, Harriman Papers,
                    Telephone Conversations)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
